during a traffic accident. In the same accident, he became infertile due to his wounds."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He was able to keep the shrine upfloat thanks to help from various family members, thus he is obligated to produce an heir to the shrine."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A real hardworker at heart, he is respected by both his brother and the local community."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fuuka is the only woman he's ever been with."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c90694"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c90695","characterName":"西野 隆之介","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c90695"},"originalCharacterName":"西野 隆之介","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The older brother of the protagonist. He only suffered light wounds during the tragic accident during their childhood, thus is healthy and fertile, unlike the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A genius overbrimming with curiosity and very free-spirited. He left the family shrine to his younger brother and move to Tokyo to pursue the career of a novelist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has quite a bit of experience with women, but he is often refused due to his abnormally large penis size and high endurance."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c90695"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/77b1794d8df831034ae3235d10d8503fcd5df389af4361f973f7b337bf4d46aa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/be/be7d363706c6348515029d48a4f86f32ce3aac5ad69ccfd5e1b07361ffbe010c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c90696","characterName":"西野 風花","sou